        "student_prefix": [
          {
            "content": "Kevin holds the world record for eating the biggest quantity of hot wings in 8 minutes. He can eat 64 wings without stopping. Alan, a boy who loves hot wings, wants to beat Kevin's record.  He is currently able to eat 5 hot wings per minute. How many more wings must he eat per minute to beat Kevin's record?",
